<div class="settingsToggleItem">多重动物转化能力<br>
<label><<radiobutton "$chimerasimplemode" 0 autocheck>>原版：完成全部任务后获得</label><br>
<label><<radiobutton "$chimerasimplemode" 1 autocheck>>前移：收集所有转化后获得</label><br>
</div>

